     "6739133f-b5bb-4f4d-be61-6c2bcd68eab6"], Cell["\<\
the image of each generator, as a polynomial in the generators\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"7e5a9d94-df54-4dad-b6b3-5f11ae8e0a61"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
